From: Active, Frozen, Missing
To: Active, SameAsFrom, Missing
Amount: ZeroOrLess, BetweenZeroAnd10K, 10K
Limit: Under, Exact, Over
Balance: Sufficient, Exact, Insufficient
Currency: Same, Different

IF NOT [From] = "Active" THEN [Limit] = "Over";
IF NOT [From] = "Active" THEN [Balance] = "Insufficient";